in a 90s retro-futuristic Great Britain.** Cheers to the old new!\n\n{1603053214459105}\n\n\ud83c\udfa1 **Experience landscapes inspired by real-world areas across the UK.** Retro's coming home.\n\n{696112643145145}\n\n\ud83d\ude98**Customise your couriermobile!** Unlock different models, colours, and trims to make hundreds of possibilities.\n\n{856541900216686}\n\n\ud83c\udfa7 **Capture the musical magic of early EDM straight into your earlobes with custom soundtracks.** Gnarly!\n\n\u23f1\ufe0f **Simulate driving as much or little as you'd like!** Optional shifters, handbrakes, turn signals, and witty banter. \n\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Are you ready for BUSINESS? You\u2019ve been chosen to undergo our state-of-the-art induction process. By becoming a ParcelPal franchisee, you can become your own boss by performing deliveries exclusively for ME! Percival Parse of ParcelPal PLC (a Pal-Co partnership). Ride the ParcelPal franchisee virtual cyber mega-highway through the most impressive display of 1990s technology in Great Britain. A life-changing experience is about to begin! Deliver your parcels and gain personal financial freedom!"}]}, "developer_name": "Cardboard Sword", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://cardboardsword.co.uk/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Cardboard Sword", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://transmissiongame.co.uk/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_m